+- Moving a member (`/members/{uid}/move`) removes them from the path project and
+  adds them to `toProjectId` with the same role. Only managers may move members,
+  and the manager must be a manager of both projects (a manager of only the source
+  gets 403). The user must be a member of the path project (else 404), the
+  destination must exist and be readable by the actor (else 404), and it must
+  differ from the source (else 400). If the user is already in the destination →
+  409. Archived source or destination → 409. Tasks the user held in the source
+  project become unassigned, so assignees stay project members.
 
